hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1137","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Girwi sawaari par uskey kharch key badley sawaar hua jaaeyga jab wo girwi ho. Aur doodh waley ka doodh uskey kharch key badley piya jaaeyga jab wo girwi ho. Aur jo sawaar ho aur piye us par kharcha hai. (Bukhari: 2512)"
"1138","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne faisla kya ke qasam muddaa alaih par hai. (Bukhari: 2514). Ghulaam aazaad karney ki kitaab."
